# PolarConnect

**Integrated Polar Science Knowledge & Media Portal**

## 🔐 Admin Demo Login

**Email:** `admin@gmail.com`
**Password:** `admin@123`

## About

PolarConnect is an AI-powered platform for managing and discovering polar science resources.

**Features:** Research Repository · AI PDF Summarization · Datasets · Media · Expeditions · Admin Approval · Search · AI Assistant · Analytics

## Tech Stack

**Next.js · React · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS · MongoDB · Vercel Blob · Auth.js · Hugging Face**

## Workflow

```text
Upload → AI Processing → Admin Approval → Search & Discover
```

## Run

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open `http://localhost:3000`

> Demo credentials only. Do not use them for production.
